      "title": "奖励领取流程（试炼链）",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 9,
      "paragraphs": [
        "击败 Yama 掉落 Silver Coin。Silver Coin 开启祖先试炼（Trial of the Ancestors）；完成试炼（经 Navali / Hinekora 流程）后获得 Tattoo of Hinekora，使用时给予 +2 武器组被动技能点。",
        "被动点非击杀直接给予。每步独立：Yama -> Silver Coin -> 试炼 -> Tattoo -> +2 点。"
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "击败 Yama -> 掉落 Silver Coin。",
        "Silver Coin -> 祖先试炼。",
        "试炼 -> Tattoo of Hinekora。",
        "使用 Tattoo -> +2 武器组被动点。"
      ]
    },
